# 🛒 Walmart Sales Dashboard

## Project Overview

This Power BI dashboard analyzes Walmart sales data to uncover sales trends, identify profitable product categories, track geographic performance, and understand order and shipping patterns.

## Dataset Columns

- Order_Date
- Shipping_Date
- Email_ID
- Geography
- Category
- Product_Name
- Sales
- Quantity
- Profit

## Key Insights

- Strong seasonal sales spikes are visible during November and December.
- Accessories and Binders are among the top categories by YTD sales.
- Geographic performance varies across regions in the United States.
- Bookcases and Machines show lower profit margins despite having reasonable sales volume.
- Month-wise trends can support inventory planning and forecasting.

## Tool Used

- Power BI
